---
// Sustainability.astro
// Section id: #sustainability
// JS binds to: #sustainability-hero, #sustainability-hero-inner,
// #sustainability-tagline, #sustainability-title, #sustainability-title-pre,
// #sustainability-title-main, #sustainability-desc,
// #sustainability-items, .sustainability-item, .sustainability-item-num,
// #sustainability-rive-canvas-harvesting, #sustainability-rive-canvas-text.
// All ids, classes, and data-* attributes are preserved verbatim.
---

<div id="sustainability" class="section">
  <div class="section__inner o-container">

    <!-- Hero text block -->
    <div id="sustainability-hero">
      <div id="sustainability-hero-inner">
        <div id="sustainability-tagline" class="sub2">UNSW Software Engineering (Honours)</div>
        <div id="sustainability-title">
          <h4 id="sustainability-title-pre">2026</h4>
          <h2 id="sustainability-title-main">key achievements</h2>
        </div>
        <div id="sustainability-desc" class="body2">
          Three things from this year
          <br>I would put on a wall:
          <br>a launch, a prize,
          <br>and a lead role in my first term.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Three stat items -->
    <div id="sustainability-items" class="o-grid">

      <div class="sustainability-item">
        <h3 class="sustainability-item-title">BOTH STORES<br />IN TWO MONTHS</h3>
        <div class="sustainability-item-desc body2">
           SportLogic Play, from a stalled prototype to the App Store and Google Play
           as the only engineer, with the marketing site, the store listings, two
           films and a sales deck built around it.
        </div>
        <div class="sustainability-item-num">1</div>
      </div>

      <div class="sustainability-item">
        <h4 class="sustainability-item-title">Optiver <br />Industry Prize</h4>
        <div class="sustainability-item-desc body2">
          SENG3011's industry prize, for the Financial Sentiment and Market Event
          Visualiser: sixty years of prices against news sentiment as a 3D star map,
          three AWS services, built solo.
        </div>
        <canvas id="sustainability-rive-canvas-harvesting"></canvas>
      </div>

      <div class="sustainability-item">
        <h4 class="sustainability-item-title">LEAD IN MY <br />FIRST TERM.</h4>
        <div class="sustainability-item-desc body2">
           Joined Sunswift new to Flutter and to cars. Seven centre-display screens,
           navigation and a voice assistant by the end of the term; now Infotainment
           Lead and TSS Lead across five SR8 projects, and in the first intake of
           UNSW's Engineering Leadership Program.
        </div>
        <canvas id="sustainability-rive-canvas-text"></canvas>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</div>
